onsumers. That interval is not in the hunks. The alias's prior existence is weak evidence it was freezing the value. Confirm no rebinding, or keep the alias.\n\n### Not faulted\n\nByte preservation is right end to end (`newline=\"\"` on both read and write, edit confined to the value span, parse on a normalized copy). Bounded candidate spans plus full-dict `tomllib` equality genuinely defeats the multiline-string, nested-table, quoted-key and comment decoys, and the `len(spans) != 1` refusal is the correct response to ambiguity rather than a guess. Removing `_OI_ID_RE` is a real dead-reader deletion.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"f6c39291-bd13-45ab-b837-845dec07d487","total_cost_usd":1.007746,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54091,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":17310,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54091,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":17310,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54091,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54091},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":33991,"outputTokens":17,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.034076,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":17310,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":54091,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.97367,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"49792266-b27c-4243-bca4-ec739db0a95e"}
